# Web app data (web/public/data, ~116 MB) IS tracked in the private repo so the site can be built
# with `npm install && npm run build` alone. Regenerate with `make appdata`. See DECISIONS.md.

# Web: self-hosted DuckDB-WASM bundles (copied from node_modules at build)
web/public/duckdb/
web/public/maplibre/
web/.serve.pid
web/e2e/artifacts/
.dev.vars

# Private notes (people, replies): never committed
private/
